{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05805","headline":"奉和圣制荅二相出雀鼠谷 · 徐安贞","name":"奉和圣制荅二相出雀鼠谷","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"两臣初入梦，二月扈巡边。\n涧北寒犹在，山南春半传。\n颂声先奉御，辰象复回天。\n云日明千里，旌旗照一川。\n柳阴低辇路，草色变新田。\n还望汾阳近，宸游自窅然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐安贞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05805.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05805","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}